`eventually_nonempty_localChartPacketsC14Z_FAMZ`, lane C14-FAM-Z, every parameter clause verbatim)
the complete final boundary family with all four regions `univ` exists on the same scale `ρ`, with
the orientation `hor i` of the closed producer. Assembly: `LocalPacketsOnBF.ofClosedC14` of the
complete closed family, the two-stratum bound from the closed rank exclusion
(`exists_eventual_scaled_strata_without_three`, as in
`eventually_nonempty_localPacketsOnBFR_closed_BCG5`; its volume threshold folded into `w₀`), the
